@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
title Class structure — View a youth's record
class MentorYouthRecordHandler <<handler>> {
  +HandleAsync(childId): RecordResult
}
class MentorYouthRecordDto <<contract>> {
  +Id: Guid
  +Name: string
  +PreferredName: string?
  +Pronouns: string?
  +Age: int?
  +School: string?
  +Programs: string[]
  +Mentor: string?
  +Guardians: MentorGuardianContactDto[]
  +RecentAttendance: MentorAttendanceDto[]?
}
class MentorGuardianContactDto <<contract>> {
  +Name: string
  +Relationship: string
  +Mobile: string?
  +Email: string?
  +IsPrimary: bool
}
class MentorAttendanceDto <<contract>> {
  +Session: string
  +At: DateTimeOffset
  +Status: string
}
class Child <<entity, tenant-owned>> {
  +FirstName, LastName, School
  -DateOfBirth (age only)
  -Allergies, Medication, Conditions, Doctor
  -HealthCard, Notes
}
class YouthOnboarding <<entity, tenant-owned>> {
  +PreferredName
  +Pronouns
}
class MentorScope <<application service>>
MentorYouthRecordHandler --> MentorScope
MentorYouthRecordHandler ..> Child
MentorYouthRecordHandler ..> YouthOnboarding : via the youth membership linked to the child
MentorYouthRecordHandler --> MentorYouthRecordDto
MentorYouthRecordDto *-- MentorGuardianContactDto
MentorYouthRecordDto *-- MentorAttendanceDto
note right of Child : Fields marked - are never\ncopied into the mentor contract\n(L2-064 c3, L2-007, L2-019)
@enduml
